:: Flats Kitchen
<<effects>><<wearProp "mop">>

You enter the <<persons>> flat and walk through a spotless living room into a filthy kitchen. Plates are stacked above the rim of the sink, crumbs cover the counters, and something sticky has dried across the floor.
<br><br>
"I said it was a tip," <<he>> says, scratching the back of <<his>> neck. "Parents are visiting soon. You arrived at the right time." <<He>> opens the fridge, takes out a can of cider, then retreats to the living room. "I'll be in there."
<br><br>

You start with the floor, loosening the dried mess with the mop before going over it again with clean water. Once your shoes stop sticking, you sweep the counters clear and wipe them down.
<br><br>

The dishes take longer. You scrape dried food from the plates, wash them in batches, then stack them beside the sink to dry. Some are badly chipped, worse than the ones at the orphanage, but you clean them all the same.
